  <p id="c-nanshi-011-wangshunhua:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-011-wangshunhua:p001:m0000" ref="w4m_9tw_147_F">和</persName><persName id="c-nanshi-011-wangshunhua:p001:m0001" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAA*A">王皇后</persName>諱<persName id="c-nanshi-011-wangshunhua:p001:m0005" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAA*A">蕣華</persName>，琅邪臨沂人，太尉<persName id="c-nanshi-011-wangshunhua:p001:m0016" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAA">儉</persName>之孫也。初為隨王妃，中興元年為皇后。<persName id="c-nanshi-011-wangshunhua:p001:m0035" ref="w4m_9tw_147_F">帝</persName>禪位，后降為妃。妃祖<persName id="c-nanshi-011-wangshunhua:p001:m0046" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAA">儉</persName>自有傳。</p>
</text>
